title: "Atoma"
abstract: "Atoma is experimental, source-bound verification for an explicitly closed Zig subset. It provides canonical contracts, a syntax screen, typechecked Idris2 specifications, Agda proofs of a store-free model and a finite u8 source pilot. It is not yet a general sound verifier for Zig. Evidence remains INCOMPLETE (Warrant): finite-model replay runs through ECHIDNA and coqchk, while compiler and refinement arguments and the full kernel chain remain unfinished."
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-22"
url: "https://github.com/hyperpolymath/atoma"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hyperpolymath/atoma"
license: MPL-2.0
